* Dealumination Project in University of Notre Dame
Author: Seungmin (Henry) Lee
Advisor: William F. Schneider

** Description
GMF folder - Global Mean Field (GMF) for 2nd order dealumination

kMC - kinetic Monte Carlo for dealumination transferred from Zeolite Monte Carlo (ZMC) developed by Anshuman Goswami (https://github.com/Anshu2711/zmc/)

